/*
# What mod this is?
This mod is suppose to expose the win32 titlebar on UWP apps, for classic theme
or other themes. This mod was NOT made by me, but rather Erizur who made this mod.
https://github.com/Erizur

## Why a re-upload?
The other current windhawk mod has issues where it breaks easily, and has general massive issues
after a update.

## what are the issues?
Issues after testing includes:
 - broken winaero with UWP
 - broken borders 
 - system instability
 - random graphical issues with classic theme.

## will this be ever updated?

simply put it, Never, This mod was never made by me, and theres little to no need to 
update it.

## should i keep it?

Running older versions of windows (10 21H2 - 11 24H2) will work with this mod as i tested it.
but any testing with 26H2 and above has NOT been done and i do not recommend it.

i would suggest using the other current windhawk mod as that has been fixed for 26H2.
*/
// ==/WindhawkModReadme==

